  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_357_0": "\\m1　 情報&交換だ！",
  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_394_0": "そうこのアイテムを売る",
  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_395_0": "もどる",
  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_399_0": "\\m1　 買い&取らせて&もらおう！",
  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_400_0": "\\m2　 ぜんぶ&買い取った&よ～？",
  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_401_0": "\\m2　 なにも&ないよ～！",
