  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_488_0": "\\m1　 OK！&ぶきを&見せてくれ！",
  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_489_0": "\\m1　 OK！&ぼうぐを&見せてみろ！",
  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_490_0": "\\m1　 こいつは&いい&スクラップに&なるッ！",
  "obj_shop_ch2_music_slash_Draw_0_gml_491_0": "\\m1　 そうか&なら&返そう",
